{"verse_key": "13:17", "surah": 13, "verse": 17, "text_uthmani": "أَنزَلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً فَسَالَتْ أَوْدِيَةٌۢ بِقَدَرِهَا فَٱحْتَمَلَ ٱلسَّيْلُ زَبَدًا رَّابِيًا ۚ وَمِمَّا يُوقِدُونَ عَلَيْهِ فِى ٱلنَّارِ ٱبْتِغَآءَ حِلْيَةٍ أَوْ مَتَـٰعٍ زَبَدٌ مِّثْلُهُۥ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يَضْرِبُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْحَقَّ وَٱلْبَـٰطِلَ ۚ فَأَمَّا ٱلزَّبَدُ فَيَذْهَبُ جُفَآءً ۖ وَأَمَّا مَا يَنفَعُ ٱلنَّاسَ فَيَمْكُثُ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يَضْرِبُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْأَمْثَالَ", "translation": "He sends down from the sky, rain, and valleys flow according to their capacity, and the torrent carries a rising foam. And from that [ore] which they heat in the fire, desiring adornments and utensils, is a foam like it. Thus Allāh presents [the example of] truth and falsehood. As for the foam, it vanishes, [being] cast off; but as for that which benefits the people, it remains on the earth. Thus does Allāh present examples.", "verse_from_ms": 432180, "verse_to_ms": 483430, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "أَنزَلَ", "start_ms": 432180, "end_ms": 434190}, {"i": 1, "text": "مِنَ", "start_ms": 434190, "end_ms": 434470}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ", "start_ms": 434470, "end_ms": 436910}, {"i": 3, "text": "مَآءً", "start_ms": 436910, "end_ms": 439680}, {"i": 4, "text": "فَسَالَتْ", "start_ms": 439680, "end_ms": 440740}, {"i": 5, "text": "أَوْدِيَةٌۢ", "start_ms": 440740, "end_ms": 442330}, {"i": 6, "text": "بِقَدَرِهَا", "start_ms": 442330, "end_ms": 443510}, {"i": 7, "text": "فَٱحْتَمَلَ", "start_ms": 443510, "end_ms": 444470}, {"i": 8, "text": "ٱلسَّيْلُ", "start_ms": 444470, "end_ms": 445300}, {"i": 9, "text": "زَبَدًا", "start_ms": 445300, "end_ms": 446190}, {"i": 10, "text": "رَّابِيًا", "start_ms": 446190, "end_ms": 447800}, {"i": 11, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 447800, "end_ms": 449190}, {"i": 12, "text": "وَمِمَّا", "start_ms": 449190, "end_ms": 450370}, {"i": 13, "text": "يُوقِدُونَ", "start_ms": 450370, "end_ms